{"suttaId":"tha-ap266","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8447,8459],"vripara":"14"},"segments":{"tha-ap266:0.3":"Padīpadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap266:1.1":"“Devabhūto ahaṃ santo, oruyha pathaviṃ tadā;","tha-ap266:1.3":"Padīpe pañca pādāsiṃ, pasanno sehi pāṇibhi.","tha-ap266:2.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ padīpamadaṃ tadā;","tha-ap266:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, dīpadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap266:3.1":"“Pañcapaññāsake kappe, eko āsiṃ mahīpati;","tha-ap266:3.3":"Samantacakkhunāmena, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap266:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap266:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā padīpadāyako [apaṇṇadīpiyo (sī. ka.)] thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap266:6.1":"Padīpadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
